<h2>Who has checked the plan?</h2><p>These receipts show retrieval from Brain. They do not claim native assistant memory was rewritten.</p><% const receipts=board.receipts||[]; if(!receipts.length) { %><p>No assistant retrieval receipts are available yet.</p><% } %><ul><% receipts.forEach(receipt=>{ %><li><strong><%= receipt.agent_label %></strong><span>Retrieved version <%= receipt.last_seen_version %></span><time><%= formatDate(receipt.last_seen_at) %></time><% if(receipt.last_seen_version<board.project.version) { %><small>Has not retrieved the latest version yet</small><% } %></li><% }) %></ul>